<title>HONG KONG: Nichimen HK sets HK$50 mln step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Nichimen HK sets HK$50 mln step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up fixed rate note issue was announced by arranger Tokyo-Mitsubishi International (HK).</p>
<p>BORROWER  NICHIMEN HONG KONG (CAYMAN) LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$50 MLN  COUPON     STEP-UP**  MATURITY  24.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	FIXED RATE ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> PUTS	--	   CALLS	--	   FULL FEES 20BP</p>
<p> LISTING   HONG KONG  REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING    NIS A	SALES LMTS STANDARD   PAY FREQ  SEMIANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	  CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  JAPAN	PAY DATE  24.DEC.96</p>
<p>SOLE ARRANGER  TOKYO-MITSUBISHI INTERNATIONAL (HK)</p>
<p> NOTES   **COUPON 6.52 PCT PER ANNUM FOR THE FIRST TWO AND HALF</p>
<p>	     YEARS, 7.93 PCT PER ANNUM THEREAFTER UNTIL MATURITY.</p>
<p>	  ***ISSUED OFF THE BORROWER'S US$300 MLN ASIAN MEDIUM</p>
<p>	     TERM NOTE PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
